 s vampire take on the Jim Crow South in Sinners\, featuring Michael B. Jor
 dan as twin brothers. Critics are calling it 'gory\, horny\, relevant\,' s
 o you'll want to be sure to see it on our 97-foot screen in immersive Dolb
 y Atmos sound.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/for-your-consid
 eration/sinners\n\nEstimated start: 21:30
